                        Be sure to explain why your set of vectors is a basis
                        for <m>\text{Nul}(B)</m>.
                    </p>
                </statement>
            </task>

            <task>
                <statement>
                    <p>
                        Among the vectors <m>{\vec v}_{1}</m>,
                        <m>{\vec v}_{2}</m>, <m>{\vec v}_{3}</m>,
                        <m>{\vec v}_{4}</m>, and <m>{\vec v}_{5}</m>, what is
                        the largest linearly independent set you can find and
                        why?
                    </p>
                </statement>
            </task>
        </exercise>
